，做出全力下劈的姿态。她的对面，是一个体型是她三倍、肌肉爆炸的暗红色皮肤牛头人首领，它手持一柄巨大的骸骨双刃战斧，咆哮着用牛角向前发起野蛮冲撞。两者在画面中央即将碰撞，武器交织处迸发出魔法的火星，形成强烈的动态对抗张力，采用低角度仰拍以凸显压迫感。\n\n**场景与氛围：**\n背景是一座宏伟但已破败的古老神殿内部，巨大的石柱倒塌在地，地面散落着碎石和断裂的武器。墙壁上插着燃烧的火把，是场景的主要光源，投下长长的、摇曳的影子。空气中弥漫着灰尘和魔法的光粒。整体氛围黑暗、史诗、充满危险。\n\n**光影与风格：**\n强烈的戏剧性光影，主光源是墙壁上火把的暖色侧光，辅以女战士剑上符文的冷色光，以及从殿堂高处裂缝射入的冰冷顶光。形成高对比度的明暗关系，突出战斗的激烈与角色的立体感。风格为细节丰富的暗黑奇幻游戏宣传海报，写实渲染，电影质感，景深效果。\n\n**画面比例：** 16:9"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 7, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 8, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [423.83001708984375, 177.11770629882812], "pos": [1444.3359375, 266.26300048828125], "id": 8, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [976.0567626953125, 1060.9766845703125], "pos": [2484.3359375, 266.26300048828125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 9, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [9], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [210, 46], "pos": [2213.466552734375, 344.17718505859375], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 10, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 11, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [5], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [315, 106], "pos": [374.3359375, 1066.2630615234375], "widgets_values": [1472, 1104, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {"batch_size": true, "width": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [8], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [480, 590], "pos": [284.3359375, 156.2630157470703], "widgets_values": ["核心故事： 在无人踏足的太古森林深处，一位精类（Fey）生物能捕捉月光，并在月光飞蛾的帮助下，将其纺织成拥有实体和魔力的银色丝绸。\n\n提示词：\n一幅充满魔法与诗意的奇幻插画，画风融合了吉卜力的想象力与阿尔丰斯·穆夏的装饰艺术风格。画面描绘了一位优雅的、非人类的“纺织者”，TA的皮肤在月色下呈现珍珠母贝般的虹彩光泽，银色的长发如瀑布般垂下，发丝间缠绕着微小的光点。TA站在一片被发光苔藓覆盖的林间空地中，周围是银白色的桦树林。TA的双手优雅地举起，正将从天而降的、如液体般流动的浓郁月光，引导向一台由水晶和古木构成的空灵织机。成百上千只巨大的月光飞蛾（Lunar Moths）环绕着TA飞舞，它们的翅膀如同彩色玻璃般绚丽，每一次振翅都会洒下发光的鳞粉。这些飞蛾正用口器衔着月光丝线，协助TA进行编织。画面要充满强烈的“圣光”效果（God Rays）和梦幻的镜头光晕（Bloom），重点表现月光作为一种“可触摸”的流体物质的质感，以及飞蛾翅膀的半透明虹彩效果。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.5.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_co